    "description": "The Pencil Camera app is designed to allow you to sketch all your life\r\n\r\nSketch your daily life with the Pencil Camera app.\r\n\r\n* Version 1.1.1 update feature\r\nA service that converts photos using an artificial neural network has been added.\r\n- Convert to anime style\r\n- Delete background\r\n- Improve resolution\r\n- Convert black and white photos to color photos\r\n- ...\r\n\r\n* Version 1.1.0 update feature\r\n- Added image editing function (crop, rotate, filter,...)\r\n- Display elapsed time during video recording\r\n\r\n* Version 1.0.15 update feature \r\n\r\n - Fixed SSL security issues\r\n\r\n* Version 1.0.14 update feature \r\n\r\n- Added Quick launcher \r\n  Quick launcher can be used to quickly run frequently used apps.\r\n\r\n- Added Effect line mode\r\n  Express your emotions on the screen using effect lines.\r\n\r\n- Added Spiral filter\r\n\r\n\r\n* Feature\r\n  - Various cartoon effects can be displayed in real time.\r\n  - Portraits, cartoon effects, sketch effects, and more.\r\n  - You can check the pictures and videos in the gallery.\r\n  - Self-camera feature\r\n  - You can create comics movie  by yourself\r\n  - picture import function\r\n  - \"no filter\" mode(=silent camera)\r\n  - video playback mode\r\n\r\nKeyword : sketch , sketch camera , pencil , manga , cartoon , toon , comics , comic movie , camart cartoon , comics camera , cartoon camera, silent camera",
